cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper and the archived software version."
title: "hydrowedge: force-dipole microswimmers in a wedge"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: "Zidanek"
    given-names: "Dejan"
    affiliation: "The Open University"
repository-code: "https://github.com/dejzid/hydrowedge_trajectory"
abstract: >-
  Wall-induced velocities and trajectories of axial and transverse force-dipole
  swimmers in a wedge, with the cases and results behind the trajectory figures of
  the paper "Hydrodynamics of active self-propulsion under wedge-shaped confinements".
keywords:
  - microswimmers
  - Stokes flow
  - wedge confinement
  - force dipole
  - low Reynolds number
